      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "While rather dim-witted on their own, as a large group they almost seem to be of a singular mind, and this level of teamwork makes them scary indeed when it comes to warfare. During the defense of their world Crenshaw IX against the Florans, they decimated the opposition in a matter of minutes using constantly shifting formations not unlike moving fractal patterns."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "大集団として、彼らはほとんど独創的な心を持つように思え、チームワークのこのレベルは、戦争に関しては確かに彼らを怖がらせる。 世界の防御中に、彼らはフラクタルパターンを移動させるのと変わらないように絶えず変化するフォーメーションを使用して、数分で反対を斬った。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "This mistake was repeated once more by the Apex, fifty years later, in their ill-advised expansion attempt into Thelusian territory. Since then, none have dared to challenge them in open warfare. There are other reasons to fear them beyond just instantaneous formation adjustments. Imagine a foe where, if you cut off two of his limbs...he simply wouldn't consider it"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "その五十年後、エイペックスはセルーシアンの領域へ無謀な拡張を試み、同じ過ちを再び犯した。 それ以来、オープンな戦争で彼らに挑戦する勇気はありませんでした。 瞬間的な形成調整を超えてそれらを恐れる理由は他にもあります。 敵を想像してみて下さい彼の手足を二本切り落とせば"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/2",
      "value": "a terribly unfortunate thing? He's still got several more limbs and every one of them is capable of killing you despite the injuries you've caused. Now multiply this foe by ten million. Now put a squad of rookies with weapons of any sort in the midst of that. How do you see it going?"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/2",
      "value": "ひどい不幸なこと? 彼はまだいくつかのさらなる手足を持っていて、それらの一つはあなたが引き起こした怪我にもかかわらずあなたを殺せる。 今度はこの対戦を一〇〇〇万倍にしよう。 では、その中にどんな種類の武器を使っても、ルーキーの部隊を配置してみましょう。 どうやって行くと思いますか?"
    }
